SUMMARY:✈️ Arrive at Pearson Terminal 3
DESCRIPTION:Arrive 3 hours early for international flights. Partner: bring 
 Chinese passport\, US visa (confirm it's multiple-entry\, M) and PR card.
END:VEVENT
