SUMMARY:✈️ Porter PD 783 Toronto → Liberia
DESCRIPTION:About 5h 44m nonstop. Departure is Toronto time\, landing is lo
 cal time (1 hour behind Toronto). After landing\, get the entry stamp (che
 ck it's in your passport)\, collect bags\, then head to the Dollar shuttle
  stop.\n\n📍 Daniel Oduber Quirós International Airport\, Corredor Chor
 otega\, Llano Grande\, Liberia\, Guanacaste\n🧭 https://www.google.com/m
 aps/dir/?api=1&destination=Daniel%20Oduber%20Quir%C3%B3s%20International%2
 0Airport
LOCATION:Daniel Oduber Quirós International Airport\, Corredor Chorotega\,
  Llano Grande\, Liberia\, Guanacaste
