SUMMARY:🚗 Pick up the car
DESCRIPTION:Bring your physical licence\, passport\, and a credit card in t
 he driver's name (deposit ~USD1\,000). Inspect the car and take photos\; c
 heck by hand that the doors are locked\, as rental car break-ins are commo
 n here.\n\n🚗 Getting there: about 4 min drive from Daniel Oduber Quiró
 s International Airport (3.4 km)\n\n📍 Dollar Rent a Car Liberia\, Corre
 dor Chorotega\, Llano Grande\, Liberia\, Guanacaste\n🧭 https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Dollar%20Rent%20a%20Car%20Liberia
LOCATION:Dollar Rent a Car Liberia\, Corredor Chorotega\, Llano Grande\, Li
 beria\, Guanacaste
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Dollar%20Rent%20a%20
 Car%20Liberia
GEO:10.60314;-85.51284
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Corredor Chorotega, Llano 
 Grande, Liberia, Guanacaste";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Dollar Rent a Car
  Liberia":geo:10.60314,-85.51284
END:VEVENT
