SUMMARY:🏨 Check in at Playas del Coco
DESCRIPTION:About 35 min from the Dollar office\, arrive before dark.\n\n
 🕘 Hours: Check-in from 14:00 (until about 20:00)\, check-out 11:00\n
 🚗 Getting there: about 35 min drive from Dollar Rent a Car Liberia (28 
 km)\n\n📍 Villa Del Sol Boutique Hotel\, Playas del Coco\, Calle La Chor
 rera\, Playas del Coco\, Sardinal\, Guanacaste\n🧭 https://www.google.co
 m/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Villa%20Del%20Sol%20Boutique%20Hotel%2C%20Pl
 ayas%20del%20Coco
