DTSTAMP:20261119T234308Z
DTSTART:20270107T220000Z
DTEND:20270107T233000Z
SUMMARY:🏨 Check in to the Monteverde hotel
DESCRIPTION:0.8 km from the town centre\; rest a bit and grab a jacket: Mon
 teverde evenings are only in the teens and often windy with drizzle.\n\n
 🕘 Hours: Check-in from 14:00\, check-out 12:00\, 24-hour front desk\n
 🚗 Getting there: about 12 min drive from 100% Aventura Zipline (5.9 km)
 \n\n📍 Hotel Montaña Monteverde\, Calle Manaquín\, Cerro Plano\, Monte
 verde\, Puntarenas\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destinatio
 n=Hotel%20Monta%C3%B1a%20Monteverde
LOCATION:Hotel Montaña Monteverde\, Calle Manaquín\, Cerro Plano\, Montev
 erde\, Puntarenas
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Hotel%20Monta%C3%B1a
 %20Monteverde
GEO:10.3115843;-84.816105
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Calle Manaquín, Cerro Pla
 no, Monteverde, Puntarenas";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hotel Montaña Mon
 teverde":geo:10.3115843,-84.816105
