BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T234308Z
DTSTART:20270107T233000Z
DTEND:20270108T013000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ Rainforest night walk
DESCRIPTION:At Bajo del Tigre (Children’s Eternal Rainforest) a guide lea
 ds you by flashlight to find tree frogs\, snakes\, spiders and sleeping bi
 rds\, and with luck sloths and agoutis. USD30 + tax per person\, minimum 2
 \; about 5 minutes’ drive from the hotel. The trails are forest dirt pat
 hs\, so wear closed non-slip shoes and bring a rain jacket and bug spray.\
 n\n🕘 Hours: Opens 7:00 for day visits (closes about 16:00)\; night walk
  daily at 17:30\, about 2 h\, reservation needed\n🚗 Getting there: abou
 t 4 min drive from Hotel Montaña Monteverde (1.6 km)\n\n📍 Bajo del Tig
 re\, Bosque Eterno de los Niños\, Monteverde\, Bajo del Tigre\, Cerro Pla
 no\, Monteverde\, Puntarenas\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&
 destination=Bajo%20del%20Tigre%2C%20Bosque%20Eterno%20de%20los%20Ni%C3%B1o
 s%2C%20Monteverde\nBajo del Tigre rates and booking: https://acmcr.org/en/
 rates-and-reservations/\nAlternative: Monteverde Cloud Forest Reserve nigh
 t walk: https://mytanfeet.com/booking/monteverde-cloud-forest-reserve-nigh
 t-walk/
LOCATION:Bajo del Tigre\, Bosque Eterno de los Niños\, Monteverde\, Bajo d
 el Tigre\, Cerro Plano\, Monteverde\, Puntarenas
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Bajo%20del%20Tigre%2
 C%20Bosque%20Eterno%20de%20los%20Ni%C3%B1os%2C%20Monteverde
GEO:10.3056389;-84.8144494
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Bajo del Tigre, Cerro Plan
 o, Monteverde, Puntarenas";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Bajo del Tigre, Bos
 que Eterno de los Niños, Monteverde":geo:10.3056389,-84.8144494
END:VEVENT
