DTSTAMP:20261119T234308Z
DTSTART:20270108T143000Z
DTEND:20270108T173000Z
SUMMARY:🚗 Down to La Fortuna
DESCRIPTION:Down Route 606\, via Cañas and Tilarán\, then along the north
  shore of Lake Arenal\; all paved\, about 4 hours of driving. Skip the dir
 t shortcut from Monteverde to Tilarán.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T234308Z
DTSTART:20270108T173000Z
DTEND:20270108T193000Z
SUMMARY:📸 North shore of Lake Arenal
DESCRIPTION:Follow the winding Route 142 and stop at roadside viewpoints fo
 r photos of the lake and volcano\; lunch in Nuevo Arenal.\n\n🕘 Hours: S
 elva Paraiso coffee shop by the lake\, daily 8:30–17:30\n🚗 Getting th
 ere: about 175 min drive from Hotel Montaña Monteverde (119 km)\n\n📍 N
 uevo Arenal\, Guanacaste\, Costa Rica\, Ruta 142\, Nuevo Arenal\, Tilarán
 \, Guanacaste\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Nue
 vo%20Arenal%2C%20Guanacaste%2C%20Costa%20Rica
