DESCRIPTION:All the driving done in daylight. Once the room is ready\, star
 t with the hotel hot spring pools.\n\n🕘 Hours: Check-in from 14:00\, ch
 eck-out 11:00\; hot springs open daily 11:00–21:00 (guest hours per the 
 hotel)\n🚗 Getting there: about 55 min drive from Nuevo Arenal (39 km)\n
 \n📍 Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna\, Vía 142\, 4.6 km al oeste del p
 arque\, La Fortuna\, Alajuela\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1
