SUMMARY:🛍️ Souvenir shopping in town
DESCRIPTION:Do a loop around the central park\; everything is within 150 m.
  Cianikal is a local artists' collective with volcanic-stone and silver je
 wellery\, ceramics\, prints and small-batch chocolate (daily 9:00–21:00)
 . Lava Collective in the park has local handmade cups\, honey and coffee (
 12:00–20:00). Galería Onírica\, north of the church\, sells original p
 aintings and jade\, at higher prices. For coffee to take home\, Mega Súpe
 r two blocks southwest of the park (7:00–21:00) is cheaper than the gift
  shops. Walk on to dinner afterwards and leave the car in town.\n\n🕘 Ho
 urs: Cianikal daily 9:00–21:00\; Lava Collective in the park daily 12:00
 –20:00\; Mega Súper about 7:00–21:00\n🚗 Getting there: about 6 min
  drive from Termales del Arenal (~4.0 km\, estimated)\n\n📍 Cianikal\, L
 a Fortuna\, 100 m al oeste de la Iglesia\, La Fortuna\, Alajuela\n🧭 htt
 ps://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Cianikal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
 \nCianikal (hours and reviews): https://wanderlog.com/place/details/459296
 \nLava Collective (hours and reviews): https://wanderlog.com/place/details
 /6971873
LOCATION:Cianikal\, La Fortuna\, 100 m al oeste de la Iglesia\, La Fortuna\
 , Alajuela
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Cianikal%2C%20La%20F
 ortuna
GEO:10.4716;-84.6469
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="100 m al oeste de la Igles
 ia, La Fortuna, Alajuela";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Cianikal, La Fortuna
 ":geo:10.4716,-84.6469
