SUMMARY:🎟️ Peñas Blancas safari float
DESCRIPTION:Hotel pickup\; you sit in an inflatable raft steered by the gui
 de\, with little or no paddling (some operators ask for a few light stroke
 s)\, for about 2 hours spotting sloths\, monkeys\, caimans and birds\; bac
 k around 11:00. You get on and off at the riverbank\, which may be muddy a
 nd rocky\, so watch your step and wear non-slip\, closed-toe water shoes.\
 n\n🕘 Hours: Float tours at 7:30 or 14:00\, about 4 h in total\; hotel p
 ickup included\n🚗 Getting there: about 30 min drive from Termales del A
 renal (~19 km\, estimated)\n\n📍 Peñas Blancas River\, San Carlos\, Cos
 ta Rica\, Río Peñas Blancas\, San Carlos\, Alajuela\n🧭 https://www.go
 ogle.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Pe%C3%B1as%20Blancas%20River%2C%20San
 %20Carlos%2C%20Costa%20Rica\nFortuna Welcome safari float · USD70 with tr
 ansfers · leaves 7:30\, about 4 hours: https://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-
 fortuna-tours/safari-float-penas-blancas-river/\nAlternative: Desafío saf
 ari float · USD72 + tax with transfers · starts 8:00\, about 3 hours\, s
 ome light paddling: https://www.desafiocostarica.com/service/safari-float-
 penas-blancas/\nAlternative: Two Weeks in Costa Rica safari float · USD69
  + tax from January\, with transfers · leaves 7:30\, about 4.5 hours: htt
 ps://www.twoweeksincostarica.com/product/safari-float-penas-blancas-river-
 group-tour/
LOCATION:Peñas Blancas River\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica\, Río Peñas Blanc
 as\, San Carlos\, Alajuela
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Pe%C3%B1as%20Blancas
 %20River%2C%20San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa%20Rica
GEO:10.39;-84.58
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Río Peñas Blancas, San C
 arlos, Alajuela";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Peñas Blancas River, San Car
 los, Costa Rica":geo:10.39,-84.58
