SUMMARY:🎟️ Mistico Hanging Bridges Park
DESCRIPTION:About 25 min drive. 3.2 km loop with gentle slopes and steps\; 
 the hanging bridges sway\; ~2 hours. Tag along behind a guided group and y
 ou'll often spot small creatures like eyelash vipers. Watch your footing o
 n the slopes. Last entry 15:50.\n\n🕘 Hours: Daily from 6:00\, last entr
 y 15:50\, closes about 16:30\n🚗 Getting there: about 30 min drive from 
 La Fortuna (20 km)\n\n📍 Mistico Arenal Hanging Bridges Park\, Calle San
 gregado\, 2 km al este de la represa\, La Fortuna\, Alajuela\n🧭 https:/
 /www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Mistico%20Arenal%20Hanging%20B
 ridges%20Park\nMistico official site: https://misticopark.com/\nAlternativ
 e: Mistico guided natural history walk · USD44 + tax · about 2.5 hours\,
  a guide spots wildlife for you: https://misticopark.com/tours/natural-his
 tory-walk/\nAlternative: Fortuna Welcome hanging bridges tour · USD70 wit
 h transfers and entry · leaves 14:00\, about 4 hours: https://www.fortuna
 welcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/arenal-hanging-bridges-tour/\nAlternative: Sk
 y Adventures hanging bridges (El Castillo\, about 40 minutes by car) · bo
 oking required: https://skyadventures.travel/hanging-bridges/
LOCATION:Mistico Arenal Hanging Bridges Park\, Calle Sangregado\, 2 km al e
 ste de la represa\, La Fortuna\, Alajuela
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Mistico%20Arenal%20H
 anging%20Bridges%20Park
GEO:10.488049;-84.753777
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Calle Sangregado, 2 km al 
 este de la represa, La Fortuna, Alajuela";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Mist
 ico Arenal Hanging Bridges Park":geo:10.488049,-84.753777
END:VEVENT
