DTSTAMP:20261119T234308Z
DTSTART:20270110T140000Z
DTEND:20270110T170000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ Horseback ride with Arenal Volcano views
DESCRIPTION:About 2.5 hours of riding through forest and pasture to a volca
 no viewpoint and Los Lirios lake\; the guide gives a lesson first. Note: k
 eeping heels down in the stirrups and pushing off one foot to mount and di
 smount put some strain on the Achilles\; if it feels tight\, keep the hors
 e at a walk.\n\n🕘 Hours: Horseback tours at 8:00 or 13:00\, about 3 h\;
  hotel pickup included\, pickup time on your voucher\n🚗 Getting there: 
 about 5 min drive from Termales del Arenal (3.3 km)\n\n📍 Los Lagos Hote
 l Spa & Resort\, La Fortuna\, Vía 142\, La Palma\, La Fortuna\, Alajuela\
 n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Los%20Lagos%20Hot
 el%20Spa%20%26%20Resort%2C%20La%20Fortuna\nFortuna Welcome horseback tour:
  https://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/arenal-volcano-horseback-
 riding-tour\nAlternative: Mistico Paco’s Horses ride · USD58 + tax · s
 tarts 8:15\, about 2.5 hours\, crosses a river on horseback: https://misti
 copark.com/tours/pacos-horses/\nAlternative: Don Tobias ride to a volcano 
 lookout · starts 8:30\, about 3 hours\, transfers included\, ask for the 
 price: https://www.arenal.net/tours/don-tobias-horseback-ride-volcano
LOCATION:Los Lagos Hotel Spa & Resort\, La Fortuna\, Vía 142\, La Palma\, 
 La Fortuna\, Alajuela
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Los%20Lagos%20Hotel%
 20Spa%20%26%20Resort%2C%20La%20Fortuna
GEO:10.4922;-84.68625
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Vía 142, La Palma, La For
 tuna, Alajuela";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Los Lagos Hotel Spa & Resort, 
 La Fortuna":geo:10.4922,-84.68625
END:VEVENT
