SUMMARY:🎟️ Sloth tour
DESCRIPTION:A guide leads you along gentle trails through farm forest looki
 ng for sloths\, often both two- and three-toed\, plus birds\, frogs and hu
 mmingbirds\; about 2.5–3 hours\, rated "easy"\, hotel pickup included. U
 SD90 per person incl. tax\, minimum 2 people.\n\n🕘 Hours: Sloth tours a
 t 8:00\, 10:00\, 13:00 and 14:30\, about 3 h\; hotel pickup included\n🚗
  Getting there: about 13 min drive from Termales del Arenal (8.9 km)\n\n
 📍 Sloth's Territory\, El Tanque\, La Fortuna\, Vía 142\, El Tanque\, L
 a Fortuna\, Alajuela\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destinat
 ion=Sloth's%20Territory%2C%20El%20Tanque%2C%20La%20Fortuna\nFortuna Welcom
 e sloth tour: https://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/arenal-sloth
 -tour/\nAlternative: Fortuna Welcome sloths + farm lunch (about 6 hours): 
 https://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/sloth-watching-campesino-f
 armer-tour
LOCATION:Sloth's Territory\, El Tanque\, La Fortuna\, Vía 142\, El Tanque\
